<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Issues — Boring Stack Weekly</title>
<meta name="description" content="Archive of Boring Stack Weekly. One practical email each week on what shipped, what broke, what the bill says, what the restore drill found.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://boringstack.org/issues/">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a">
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="../favicon.ico">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="../favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="../favicon-192x192.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="../apple-touch-icon.png">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../style.css">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="Boring Stack Weekly" href="../feed.xml">
</head>
<body>

<nav class="topbar" aria-label="primary">
  <span class="nameplate"><a href="../"><img src="../favicon-32x32.png" alt="" width="22" height="22">Boring Stack</a></span>
  <span class="links">
    <a href="../manifesto.html">manifesto</a>
    <a href="./">issues</a>
    <a href="../#newsletter">newsletter</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/boringstackoverflow/boring-stack">github</a>
  </span>
</nav>

<h1 class="hero">Boring Stack Weekly<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
<p class="subhead">One practical email each week on how to build with Boring Stack. <a href="../feed.xml">RSS</a> · <a href="../#newsletter">subscribe by email</a>.</p>

<section>
  <ol class="issue-list">
{{range .Issues}}
    <li>
      <a href="{{.Slug}}.html"><strong>{{.Title}}</strong></a>
      <span class="issue-meta">{{.DateHuman}} · issue #{{.Number}}</span>
      {{if .Summary}}<p class="issue-summary">{{.Summary}}</p>{{end}}
    </li>
{{end}}
  </ol>
</section>

<footer>
  <span><a href="../#newsletter">subscribe</a> · <a href="../feed.xml">rss</a></span>
  <span><a href="https://x.com/boringstack">@boringstack</a> / 2026 / MIT</span>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
